From 1111111111111111111111111111111111111111 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MuseumQuest Patch <patch@museumquest.local>
Date: Fri, 10 Jul 2026 14:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Fix Supabase env fallback, merge badges/achievements,
 frosted artifact popup, add Traditional Toys category

- Supabase: bake publishable URL/key fallbacks into client.ts so builds
  without VITE_* env vars (e.g. Cloudflare Workers) still connect.
- Badges & achievements: remove redundant /badges page; profile now shows
  one combined "Badges & Achievements" section with a single "View all".
- Artifact popup: modal card is now 50% transparent with frosted blur
  (bg-card/50 + backdrop-blur-xl).
- New category "toys" (Mainan Tradisional): congkak, diabolo-cina,
  catur-cina - watercolor images, 5th map zone, pins, category quest,
  totals rescaled 12->15 (halfway badge 6->8), BM/EN labels.
- New migration supabase/migrations/20260710130000_add_traditional_toys.sql
  (must be run on the Supabase database): inserts the 3 artifacts and
  quest-toys, rescales scan milestone achievements/badges/quest texts.
---
